      },
      {
        "id": "book035-b002015-p000-7c1fa42865",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "这段话讲的是结穴的脉气有半阴半阳或半阳半阴的情况，应当从化生脑下方去寻找。需要观察左右送龙的“水”流到达三爻合处的情况，辨认哪一边明亮、哪一边昏暗，哪一股长、哪一股短。作为目标的强者得阴之体，其脊背露出，形状像慈鱼的尾巴，这是分界。方法是用“饒減”来推裁，加减就是乘除的意思。如果阴阳两方面都得到适宜，那么生气就形成了；如果是阳而显得弱，就按此法推究。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book035-b002016-p000-2a30e169cb",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "脉气来到尽头处已经形成“穴”，倒杖法要在“明堂”的前后加以辨别。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book035-b002017-p000-4653852131",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "如果处所确定，就立下标竿，挂好线，以此作为正脉。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book035-b002018-p000-a6c134c884",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "heading",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "# 辨尖圓口鼻章第十",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book035-b002019-p000-45d649b4de",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "确立“穴”位时，尖圆要切合适宜，最好从界“水”下方去寻找。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book035-b002020-p000-a6e4b23c72",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "强阴露出的脊背形状像葱尾。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book035-b002021-p000-b438c8e2f8",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "前面有而后面没有，就不要下手；前面没有而后面有，也不要轻易作为。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book035-b002022-p000-6db08e98de",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "“水”流送到三爻处。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book035-b002023-p000-f184619b27",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "这段话讲的是立“向”的方法：在“明堂”与“水”合处树立标准，又在“穴”中央树立标准，再用线一牵，那么天地生成之“向”自然不容移动，所以不必用罗经，也能自然默合其理。",
